Date: Sat, 20 Jun 2026 15:29:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03105/11362] [outer-loop] flag A3 (exp4513) false win:
 baseline-metric-mismatch, lever inert

A3 logged 'success: adaptive_budget_median_actions_2984_below_7760' but it is
NOT a valid win:
- 2984 = adaptive median ACTIONS_TO_FIRST_LEVELUP; 7760 = baseline median TOTAL
  ACTIONS. Baseline never recorded actions_to_first_levelup -> apples-to-oranges.
- Proof: baseline total-actions == adaptive total-actions BYTE-IDENTICAL;
  aggregate adaptive_budget_diagnostics = commit_count 0, candidates_skipped 0
  across all 8 games -> the lever NEVER FIRED, zero causal effect. Solve-rate
  4->4 held only because the lever was inert.
- A3 ran with the original commit-1-candidate DELETE prompt; the defer-not-delete
  contract (e0af579a1) landed ~2 min too late for A3 (applies to A4/A6).

Stamped flagged_adversarial=true + corrigendum so PHASE E does not aggregate the
2984 number. Genuine insight preserved: first-levelup (lp85=20, ~offline optimum)
<< total run (7792) -> the gate should measure actions-to-first-levelup, baseline
re-measured on that metric, and the real lever is stop-at-levelup + the nav tax.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
